	(text "L401 and C401-C403 filter the protected supply. R401 provides a voltage\ndrop proportional to bus current between BUS24_PRE_SHUNT and BUS24.\nD401 indicates bus voltage; R403 and R404 provide passive discharge.\nInput: EFUSE_OUT. Output: BUS24."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
