	(text "F201 connects +24V_RAW to +24V_FUSED and provides fuse protection.\nD205 suppresses input transients. The green LED indicates fused supply\nvoltage; the red LED indicates loss of that voltage while input is present.\nInput: +24V_RAW. Output: +24V_FUSED."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 82.55 0)
