	(text "U301 and the external MOSFETs protect against reverse polarity,\nreverse current, undervoltage, overvoltage and excessive load current.\nControlled startup limits capacitive inrush. PG_INPUT and FLT_INPUT_N\nprovide power-good and fault status; JP301 provides manual shutdown.\nInput: +24V_FUSED. Output: EFUSE_OUT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 102.81 0)
